MCP23017 LED toggle via I2C on Raspberry Pi.

Wiring:
  LED  ->  GPIO0 (port A bit 0)
  Switch -> GPB7 (port B bit 7)
  VCC  ->  3.3 V
  GND  ->  GND

The MCP23017 is in its power-on default BANK=0 register mode.
"""

import signal
import sys
